The change of variables is from tau to 1/tau = sigma2, so
derivative of the (inverse) transform 1/tau = tau^{-1} is

- tau ^ {-2}

log(| - tau ^ {-2} |) = -2 * log(tau)

so you need

   increment_log_prob(-2 * log(tau));

not just

>   increment_log_prob(-log(tau));  // adjust for change of variables 1 / tau

